  "prefLabel": "Inst 104.02 Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 104.02 Quorum. A quorum of the board shall be 5 members of the board. In the absence of chair or vice chair, the chair shall designate a pro tempore officer for the officer or officers absent.\n\nSource. #8492, eff 12-24-05; amd by #10112, eff 4-14-12; amd by #10336, eff 5-15-13; ss by #14111, eff 1-17-25",
